Subject: [PATCH 11/12] x86: Require CAP_COMPROMISE_KERNEL for MSR writing
Date: Mon, 18 Mar 2013 17:32:32 -0400
Message-Id: <1363642353-30749-11-git-send-email-matthew.garrett@nebula.com>
